# Changes from draft-melnikov-email-big-files-00 {#changes}
{:numbered="false"}

* Allowed only one Content-External header field per body part, and
  used the body part's Content-ID to refer to the linked attachment.
* Added "KEY", "STORED-DIGEST-", "DESCRIPTION" and the
  Content-Disposition date parameters.
* Made "SIZE" and "DIGEST-SHA-256" required, and required "https"
  URLs.
* Removed "PERMISSION": a linked attachment can't change.
* Added the "content-external" HTML class.
* Added requirements for attachment servers, receiving servers and
  message stores.
* Wrote the Security and Privacy Considerations.

